    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · Essential AI Law (Proposed)</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Proposed Regulation · 2025</p> <h1>Essential AI Law (Proposed)</h1> <p class=\"lead\">Proposed framework for 'essential AI' — systems that impact fundamental rights. Risk-based with strict liability. CSOAI's council governance and signed attestations provide the accountability mechanism.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> EU Parliament (proposed)</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2025</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Proposed Regulation</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 3 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>Strict liability for essential AI</td><td>Signed attestations link decisions to state — accountability without ambiguity</td></tr> <tr><td>Fundamental rights impact assessment</td><td>Designed council deliberation for HIGH tier is intended to support impact assessment</td></tr> <tr><td>Transparency requirements</td><td>ASSTI 9/10, public verify URLs</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> Proposed law is not yet enacted. CSOAI is already compliant with its anticipated requirements.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">essential-ai-law-assessor-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against Essential AI Law (Proposed) and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
