    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · G7 / G20 AI Principles</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Principles · 2019</p> <h1>G7 / G20 AI Principles</h1> <p class=\"lead\">International consensus on AI governance from the world's largest economies. Human-centric, inclusive, sustainable. CSOAI operationalises these at the individual user level.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> G7 / G20</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2019</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Principles</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 4 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>Human-centric AI</td><td>Article 6 — Maternal Covenant Bond, Article 29 — Partnership Charter</td></tr> <tr><td>Inclusive growth</td><td>Article 36 — Cultural Recognition, 47 faith traditions</td></tr> <tr><td>Sustainable development</td><td>Article 45 — Open Source Core, Article 49 — Self-Host Guarantee</td></tr> <tr><td>International cooperation</td><td>CSOAI research arm, academic partnerships, open methodology</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> G7/G20 principles are intergovernmental. CSOAI provides the grassroots implementation that individuals and SMEs can adopt without government action.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">g7-g20-ai-principles-assessor-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against G7 / G20 AI Principles and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
