    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · GDPR (2016/679)</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Regulation · 2016</p> <h1>GDPR (2016/679)</h1> <p class=\"lead\">General Data Protection Regulation. Rights to access, rectification, erasure, portability and objection. CSOAI's sovereignty principle exceeds GDPR requirements.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> European Union</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2016</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Regulation</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 5 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>Article 15 — Right of access</td><td>Article 43 — Sovereignty Principle, Article 47 — Audit Right</td></tr> <tr><td>Article 17 — Right to erasure</td><td>Article 11 — Selective Forgetting, user-controlled deletion</td></tr> <tr><td>Article 20 — Data portability</td><td>Article 12 — Memory Portability, standard format export</td></tr> <tr><td>Article 22 — Automated decision-making</td><td>Article 33 — Transparency Obligations, council deliberation logs</td></tr> <tr><td>Article 35 — DPIA for high-risk processing</td><td>Layer 2: designed multi-provider council review mandatory for HIGH tier decisions</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> GDPR predates LLMs. CSOAI adds AI-specific protections: character ownership, memory graph export and model-level deletion.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">gdpr-article-checker-mcp</span> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">gdpr-dpia-generator-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against GDPR (2016/679) and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
