    "title": "CSOAI × ISO/IEC 42001 Crosswalk — 52-Article Charter mapped to ISO/IEC 42001",
    "description": "CSOAI 52-Article Partnership Charter mapped to ISO/IEC 42001 — AI Management System. The world",
    "ogTitle": "CSOAI × ISO/IEC 42001 Crosswalk",
    "ogDescription": "The CSOAI Charter mapped to ISO/IEC 42001 clause-by-clause. Free CC BY 4.0.",
    "ogImage": "",
