    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · Korea AI Basic Act</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Regulation · 2024</p> <h1>Korea AI Basic Act</h1> <p class=\"lead\">South Korea's comprehensive AI law. Risk-based classification, safety standards and support for AI industry. CSOAI's three-layer safety model satisfies high-risk requirements.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> National Assembly of Korea</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2024</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Regulation</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 3 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>High-risk AI safety standards</td><td>Care Membrane + designed multi-provider council + Signed Receipts</td></tr> <tr><td>AI safety management system</td><td>EI3 runtime, 6 trained NNs, continuous monitoring</td></tr> <tr><td>Support for AI industry</td><td>Open-source core (MIT), 313 MCP servers</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> Korea Act is domestic. CSOAI operates globally with multi-jurisdictional compliance.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">korea-ai-basic-act-assessor-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against Korea AI Basic Act and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
