    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · Maritime Law → AI Law Parallel</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Research · 2026</p> <h1>Maritime Law → AI Law Parallel</h1> <p class=\"lead\">CSOAI's original research drawing parallels between maritime law (LIMC, SOLAS, MARPOL) and AI governance. The 'flag state' model maps to AI sovereignty. The 'port state control' maps to AI auditing.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> CSOAI Research</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2026</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Research</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 5 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>Flag state = AI developer's jurisdiction</td><td>Article 43 — Sovereignty Principle — user chooses their 'flag'</td></tr> <tr><td>Port state control = AI auditor's jurisdiction</td><td>Article 47 — Audit Right — any auditor can inspect</td></tr> <tr><td>Classification society = Certification body</td><td>CSOAI measurement = independent classification</td></tr> <tr><td> SOLAS = Safety standards</td><td>EI3 three-layer safety model</td></tr> <tr><td>MARPOL = Environmental protection</td><td>Article 45 — Open Source Core = environmental sustainability of AI</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> This is CSOAI original research. No incumbent has explored maritime-AI law parallels. First-mover advantage.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">maritime-law-ai-parallel-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against Maritime Law → AI Law Parallel and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
