    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/framework-catalog\">Frameworks</a> · Montreal Declaration for Responsible AI</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Principles · 2018</p> <h1>Montreal Declaration for Responsible AI</h1> <p class=\"lead\">Ten principles for responsible AI developed by leading Canadian researchers. Well-being, autonomy, justice, privacy, knowledge, democracy. CSOAI implements all ten.</p> <div class=\"meta-box\"> <p><strong>Organisation:</strong> Université de Montréal</p> <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2018</p> <p><strong>Category:</strong> Principles</p> <p><strong>CSOAI Charter Articles:</strong> 6 mapped</p> </div> <h2>Mapping to CSOAI 52-Article Charter</h2> <table> <tr><th>Framework Requirement</th><th>CSOAI Article / Mechanism</th></tr> <tr><td>Well-being</td><td>Article 15 — Right to Evolve, care_pattern_analyzer NN</td></tr> <tr><td>Autonomy</td><td>Article 43 — Sovereignty Principle, Article 50 — Fork Right</td></tr> <tr><td>Justice</td><td>Article 36 — Cultural Recognition, Article 48 — Economic Sovereignty</td></tr> <tr><td>Privacy</td><td>Article 25 — Privacy by Design, Article 9 — Memory Sovereignty</td></tr> <tr><td>Knowledge</td><td>Article 51 — Right to Modify, open-source core</td></tr> <tr><td>Democracy</td><td>Article 29 — Partnership Charter, shared decision-making</td></tr> </table> <h2>Gaps & CSOAI Differentiation</h2> <div class=\"gap-box\"> <p><strong>Gap analysis:</strong> Montreal Declaration is academic. CSOAI provides the commercial and technical infrastructure for adoption.</p> </div> <h2>Relevant MCPs</h2> <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem\">These MCP servers can be used to audit compliance with this framework:</p> <span class=\"mcp-tag\">montreal-declaration-assessor-mcp</span> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI compliance audit against Montreal Declaration for Responsible AI and receive a signed badge with public verify URL.</p> <p><a href=\"/start\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:.5rem\">Run the free measurement →</a></p> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · ASSTI Benchmark</p>",
